sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Core as Hearth Suite Core
    participant CRDT as crdt-sync
    participant Crypto as Crypto Module
    participant Relay as Sync Relay (zero-knowledge)
    participant Obj as Encrypted Object Store
    User->>Core: edit document (offline-first)
    Core->>CRDT: apply local op, update state
    Note over Core,Relay: Sync only if user opted in
    Core->>Crypto: encrypt CRDT delta (content key)
    Core->>Relay: PUT encrypted delta (auth token)
    Relay->>Obj: store opaque blob (cannot read)
    Relay-->>Core: ack + peer deltas (encrypted)
    Core->>Crypto: decrypt peer deltas
    Core->>CRDT: merge -> converged state
    Core-->>User: changes merged
